1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:05,230
We learned one thing, Cheese:
我們學會一件事，吉事：

2
00:00:05,470 --> 00:00:08,930
Cheerleaders and high explosives don't mix.
啦啦隊長跟強力火藥 不應該混在一起

3
00:00:11,410 --> 00:00:13,310
You can say that again,Mac.
你說的沒錯，麥克

4
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:16,340
I couldn't have done it alone. You're a genius.
光靠我一個人是不行的 你是個天才

5
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:21,310
Oh,yeah? Well, how come I can't get my VCR to stop blinking 12:00?
是嗎？那為什麼我還不會調整 錄影機的定時功能

6
00:00:28,190 --> 00:00:29,680
What did you guys think?
你們覺得如何？

7
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:36,700
-Hey,the phone. -I got it. I got it.
-有電話 -我來接

8
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:39,390
Hold on. It's your mom.
等一下，是你媽媽打來的

9
00:00:39,670 --> 00:00:41,530
-It's Mommy. -That's nice.
-是他媽媽打來的 -真的是太棒了

10
00:00:41,770 --> 00:00:43,930
Ma, so what did you think?
媽，你覺得如何？

11
00:00:44,910 --> 00:00:46,070
Well...
喔…

12
00:00:46,510 --> 00:00:48,870
that was okay.
還好啦

13
00:00:49,140 --> 00:00:50,440
It wasn't the best.
它不是最棒的

14
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:53,170
That was one of the worst things ever...
那是我看過最爛的戲…

15
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:56,920
and not just on TV.
我是指所有的戲劇表演

16
00:00:57,520 --> 00:00:59,850
-What should we say? -The lighting was okay.
-我們該說什麼？ -燈光還不錯

17
00:01:00,090 --> 00:01:03,180
You got lighting last time. Lighting is mine.
上次你已經說燈光不錯 這次輪到我了

18
00:01:03,660 --> 00:01:04,680
I have costumes.
服裝是我的

19
00:01:04,930 --> 00:01:06,990
That means I'm stuck with:
那我只能說：

20
00:01:07,160 --> 00:01:11,720
"So we were watching you in there,and you were sitting right here. Whoa."
「我們看到你在電視上出現 結果你就坐在這裡，哇」

21
00:01:12,870 --> 00:01:14,890
-What about you? -I don't know.
-你呢？ -我不知道

22
00:01:15,170 --> 00:01:18,440
I can't lie to him again. Oh,no,I.. No.
我沒辦法再騙他 不，我…不

23
00:01:18,710 --> 00:01:21,440
I'm just gonna press my breasts up against him.
我要用我的胸部緊緊壓著他

24
00:01:22,810 --> 00:01:25,040
-And say nothing? -Yeah,that's right.
-什麼都不說？ -沒錯

25
00:01:27,050 --> 00:01:29,110
Wow, my folks really liked it.
哇，我爸媽很喜歡我的表演

26
00:01:29,380 --> 00:01:30,870
What did you guys think?
你們有什麼看法？

27
00:01:37,630 --> 00:01:39,060
It wasn't that good.
沒那麼好吧

28
00:01:42,060 --> 00:01:44,190
The One With Rachel's Assistant
本集播出：瑞秋的助理

00:01:42,060 --> 00:01:44,190
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

29
00:02:22,440 --> 00:02:26,200
Do you think that your favorite animal says much about you?
你認為你最喜歡的動物 能代表你嗎？

30
00:02:26,340 --> 00:02:28,100
You mean behind my back?
你是指他們背著我說我的壞話？

31
00:02:29,810 --> 00:02:32,910
You'll never believe what happened to me today.
你們一定不會相信 今天我發生了什麼事

32
00:02:33,250 --> 00:02:35,380
-I am sitting in my office.. -You guys!
-我坐在辦公室裡… -大家聽我說

33
00:02:35,580 --> 00:02:37,280
Guess what my agent just said?
你們猜我的經紀人說什麼？

34
00:02:37,550 --> 00:02:40,850
-I'm in the middle of a story here. -Sorry,you finish.
-我正說話說到一半 -抱歉，你繼續說吧

36
00:02:41,090 --> 00:02:43,960
I'm sitting in my office, and guess who walks in.
我坐在辦公室裡 你們猜誰走了進來

37
00:02:44,290 --> 00:02:46,260
I'm gonna be on two TV shows.
我要參加兩出電視劇的演出

38
00:02:46,530 --> 00:02:47,550
That's great.
那真的是太棒了

39
00:02:48,530 --> 00:02:50,460
-Joey. -You weren't finished?
-喬伊 -你還沒有說完嗎？

40
00:02:50,730 --> 00:02:53,930
Yeah, "Guess who walks into my office" is my story.
對喔，我的重點只是 「你們猜誰走進我的辦公室」

41
00:02:54,970 --> 00:02:57,100
Ralph Lauren walked into my office.
勞夫羅蘭走進我的辦公室

42
00:02:57,370 --> 00:03:01,040
If you're starting another story, at least let me finish mine.
如果你想說別的事 至少讓我把我的事說完

43
00:03:02,310 --> 00:03:03,800
It's the same story.
我說的是同一件事

44
00:03:04,450 --> 00:03:06,880
Wow, it's really long.
哇，這件事還真長

45
00:03:07,580 --> 00:03:11,280
Ralph just came in to tell me that he's so happy with my work...
勞夫走進來告訴我 他非常滿意我的工作表現…

46
00:03:11,550 --> 00:03:15,610
that he wants me to be the new merchandising manager for Polo retail.
他要我擔任 休閒衫零售部的新銷售經理

47
00:03:15,920 --> 00:03:17,920
-Still get a discount on wedding gowns? -Yeah！
-你買婚紗還有折扣嗎？ -有啊

48
00:03:18,190 --> 00:03:20,220
I'm so happy for you.
我為你感到高興

49
00:03:21,730 --> 00:03:23,990
These really are the "days of our lives."
這真的是「我們的日子」

50
00:03:25,300 --> 00:03:27,330
-What? -Well, since you ask...
-什麼？ -喔，既然你們問起…

51
00:03:27,600 --> 00:03:30,200
They want me back on Days of Our Lives.
他們要我回去演《我們的日子》

52
00:03:30,410 --> 00:03:31,840
I get a big pay raise!
我得到大幅度加薪

53
00:03:32,070 --> 00:03:33,200
Oh,hey!
嘿

54
00:03:33,440 --> 00:03:36,900
I'll be playing Drake Ramoray's twin brother, Stryker.
我要飾演德瑞克醫生的 雙胞胎弟弟史崔克

55
00:03:37,810 --> 00:03:40,250
I get to hire my own assistant.
我可以僱用專屬助理

56
00:03:41,950 --> 00:03:44,610
I got a head rush from standing up too fast.
我起來太快，現在頭很暈

57
00:03:50,430 --> 00:03:52,260
You were at this job four years?
這份工作你做了四年？

58
00:03:52,490 --> 00:03:56,950
-That's right. -This is all very impressive, Hilda.
-沒錯 -你的資歷非常棒，西爾達

59
00:03:57,230 --> 00:03:59,460
I just have one last question for you.
我還要問你一個問題

60
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:02,530
How did I do? Was this okay?
我表現得如何？還可以吧？

61
00:04:03,870 --> 00:04:06,100
-What? -I've never interviewed anyone.
-什麼？ -我從來沒有面試過任何人

62
00:04:06,340 --> 00:04:08,430
I've never had anyone work for me.
從來沒有人為我工作過

63
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:11,980
When I was a kid we had a maid, but this isn't the same.
我小時候家裡有請傭人 但這完全不一樣

64
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:14,480
No, dear, it's not.
沒錯，親愛的，的確不一樣

65
00:04:15,480 --> 00:04:16,970
And I know that.
我知道

66
00:04:18,290 --> 00:04:20,380
Well, thank you so much for coming in.
謝謝你來面試

67
00:04:20,660 --> 00:04:22,650
-Nice to meet you. -Good meeting you.
-很高興能認識你 -我也是

68
00:04:22,890 --> 00:04:24,290
All right.
好吧

69
00:04:25,790 --> 00:04:27,390
I'm a total pro.
我還真專業咧

70
00:04:28,700 --> 00:04:31,160
-Hello. -Wow.
嗨

71
00:04:32,900 --> 00:04:35,660
Hi, yes,I'm sorry. The models are down the hall.
嗨，對不起 模特兒面試在走廊盡頭的辦公室

72
00:04:35,900 --> 00:04:38,170
I'm here about the assistant job.
我是來面試助理的工作

73
00:04:38,510 --> 00:04:39,700
Really?
真的嗎？

74
00:04:40,310 --> 00:04:44,340
Okay, well, then, all right. Well,just have a seat there.
好吧，我知道了 請坐

75
00:04:44,580 --> 00:04:45,880
So what's your name?
你叫什麼名字？

76
00:04:46,180 --> 00:04:47,200
Tag Jones.
泰格瓊斯

77
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:49,280
Uh-huh,go on.
繼續

78
00:04:50,420 --> 00:04:52,410
That's it. That's my whole name.
就這樣，那是我的全名

79
00:04:52,690 --> 00:04:54,710
That's your whole name. Of course.
那是你的全名，當然

80
00:04:55,390 --> 00:04:57,690
Okay, let's just have a look-see here.
好了，我們來看一下

81
00:04:57,930 --> 00:05:01,660
I haven't worked in an office before. I don't have much experience..
我從來沒有做過辦公室工作 工作經驗不是很多…

82
00:05:01,900 --> 00:05:05,990
What are you talking about? You got three years painting houses...
你在胡說什麼？ 你當過三年油漆工…

83
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:10,160
two whole summers at TGl Friday's.
有兩個暑假在星期五餐廳打工

84
00:05:10,870 --> 00:05:12,070
It's lame, I know.
那些經驗很爛，我知道

85
00:05:12,340 --> 00:05:15,170
But I'm a goal-oriented person, eager to learn..
但我是目標導向的那種人 渴望學習…

86
00:05:15,380 --> 00:05:17,240
Just hold on a second, please.
請等一下

87
00:05:21,750 --> 00:05:25,810
It's for human resources. Everybody has to. Would you stand up?
這是人事部的要求，大家都得這麼做，能麻煩你站起來嗎？

88
00:05:33,930 --> 00:05:35,400
No,no,no.
不

89
00:05:46,440 --> 00:05:47,700
Hey.
嘿

90
00:05:52,550 --> 00:05:55,210
-Anyway,I should go. -Okay. Bye.
-總之我該走了 -好吧，再見

91
00:05:55,420 --> 00:05:57,210
-Hey,sweetie. -Hi,sweetie.
-嘿，親愛的 -嗨，甜心

92
00:05:57,450 --> 00:05:59,480
What was with all the whispering?
你們嘀嘀咕咕在說什麼？

93
00:05:59,890 --> 00:06:01,950
I can't tell you. It's a secret.
我不能告訴你，那是秘密

94
00:06:02,390 --> 00:06:05,950
Secret? Married people aren't supposed to have secrets.
秘密？夫妻不該有秘密的

95
00:06:06,230 --> 00:06:08,860
We love and respect one another too much.
我們深愛並且尊重彼此

96
00:06:10,870 --> 00:06:11,890
But still,no.
但我還是不能說

97
00:06:12,770 --> 00:06:16,900
We should tell each other everything. I don't have secrets from you.
我們應該對彼此坦誠一切 我就不會對你隱藏秘密

98
00:06:17,110 --> 00:06:21,600
Really? So tell me what happened to Ross, junior year at Disneyland.
真的嗎？告訴我羅斯在大三時 在迪士尼樂園發生了什麼事？

99
00:06:21,880 --> 00:06:23,570
No, I can't do that.
不，我不能那麼做

100
00:06:24,280 --> 00:06:26,300
I'll tell you what Phoebe said.
我會告訴你菲比說了什麼

101
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:28,140
-Okay. -Okay.
-好吧 -太棒了

102
00:06:28,420 --> 00:06:30,750
So Ross and I are going to Disneyland.
羅斯跟我 一起去迪士尼樂園玩

103
00:06:30,990 --> 00:06:33,150
We stop at this restaurant for tacos.
我們在一家餐廳吃墨西哥卷餅

104
00:06:33,420 --> 00:06:38,020
When I say restaurant, I mean a guy, a hibachi, and the trunk of his car.
事實上那只是一個傢伙 改裝了他的車子開的路邊攤

105
00:06:38,830 --> 00:06:40,690
So Ross has about ten tacos.
羅斯吃了十個墨西哥卷餅

106
00:06:40,960 --> 00:06:45,490
Anyway, we're on Space Mountain and Ross starts to feel a little iffy.
總之我們在玩太空山 羅斯開始覺得不舒服

107
00:06:45,770 --> 00:06:47,330
Oh,my God. He threw up?
天啊，他吐了嗎？

108
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:50,590
No, he visited a town a little south of throw up.
不，他從另一邊 把東西全拉了出來

109
00:06:53,910 --> 00:06:55,640
What was Phoebe's secret?
菲比有什麼秘密？

110
00:06:55,810 --> 00:06:59,840
Nancy Thompson, from Phoebe's old massage place, is getting fired.
菲比以前的按摩師同事 南西湯普森被開除了

111
00:07:03,820 --> 00:07:06,910
That's it? I gave up my Disneyland story for that?
就那樣？我為了那件事 說出迪士尼的秘密？

112
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:09,850
That's right. You lose,sucker!
沒錯，你輸了，笨蛋

113
00:07:12,430 --> 00:07:14,020
Please still marry me.
請你還是要娶我

114
00:07:17,970 --> 00:07:19,870
You have an assistant,right?
你有助理吧？

115
00:07:20,130 --> 00:07:21,160
Did she call?
她打電話來了嗎？

116
00:07:21,440 --> 00:07:25,240
You told her I was sick, right? Always tell her I am sick.
你告訴她我病了吧？ 每次都要說我生病了

117
00:07:26,140 --> 00:07:28,840
I don't know. How do you decide who to hire?
不，我只是不知道 你怎麼決定要僱用誰？

118
00:07:29,040 --> 00:07:30,740
I have it down to two people.
我把選擇範圍縮小到兩個人

119
00:07:31,010 --> 00:07:34,040
One has great references and a lot of experience.
一個的推薦信很棒，經驗非常豐富

120
00:07:34,250 --> 00:07:36,680
-And then,there's this guy. -What about him?
-還有另一個傢伙 -他怎麼了？

121
00:07:38,320 --> 00:07:39,550
I love him.
我愛他

122
00:07:41,460 --> 00:07:43,450
He's so pretty,I want to cry.
他帥呆了，我真的好想哭

123
00:07:43,660 --> 00:07:45,020
I don't know what to do.
我不知道該怎麼辦

124
00:07:45,260 --> 00:07:48,850
Come on, you know what to do. You hire the first one.
少來了，你知道自己該怎麼辦 你得僱用第一個人

125
00:07:49,060 --> 00:07:53,730
Don't hire assistants because they're cute. Do it because they're qualified.
別因為他長得帥就雇他當助理 你得考慮到他們的工作能力

126
00:07:54,470 --> 00:07:55,730
Uh-huh.

127
00:07:57,170 --> 00:08:01,510
I hear you. You make a lot of sense. Can I just say one more thing?
我知道了，你說的有道理 我可以再說一件事嗎？

128
00:08:01,740 --> 00:08:02,970
Look how pretty.
他真的很帥

129
00:08:05,050 --> 00:08:06,070
Let me see.
讓我看看

130
00:08:07,080 --> 00:08:09,070
Oh, my God.
我的天啊

131
00:08:09,580 --> 00:08:11,610
Oh. But,no.
但還是不行

132
00:08:11,890 --> 00:08:15,080
No. You can't hire him because it's not professional.
不，你不能僱用他 因為那麼做太不專業了

133
00:08:16,890 --> 00:08:18,880
This is for me, yes?
這是給我的，對吧？

134
00:08:19,730 --> 00:08:22,860
Okay,you're right. I'll hire Hilda tomorrow.
好吧，你說的對 明天我會僱用西爾達

135
00:08:23,100 --> 00:08:25,860
Dumb, old, perfect-for-the-job Hilda.
那個又蠢又老，適合這份工作的西爾達

136
00:08:26,630 --> 00:08:27,690
Let me see.
讓我瞧瞧

137
00:08:29,700 --> 00:08:31,600
Wow!

138
00:08:31,870 --> 00:08:33,900
Don't show this to Monica.
別讓摩妮卡看到照片

139
00:08:34,110 --> 00:08:36,540
And don't tell her about the "Wow!"
別告訴她我說：「哇」

140
00:08:39,819 --> 00:08:41,684
（我們的日子）

141
00:08:43,750 --> 00:08:45,180
-Hey,Joey. -Hey,Terry.
-嗨，喬伊 -嗨，泰瑞

142
00:08:45,420 --> 00:08:47,610
-Nice to see you again. -Been a while.
-很高興能再跟你見面 -好久不見

143
00:08:47,860 --> 00:08:50,690
Funny,these halls look smaller than they used to.
真有趣，這裡的走廊看起來比以前小

144
00:08:51,390 --> 00:08:53,260
It's a different building.
我們搬家了

145
00:08:54,500 --> 00:08:55,550
So...
那麼…

146
00:08:56,060 --> 00:08:58,290
Stryker Ramoray, huh?
史崔克是吧？

147
00:08:58,570 --> 00:09:00,800
-When do I start? -How about right now?
-我什麼時候開始？ -何不現在就開始呢？

148
00:09:01,070 --> 00:09:02,430
Okay.
好吧

149
00:09:03,040 --> 00:09:05,130
Here are the audition scenes.
這是試鏡的劇本

150
00:09:08,780 --> 00:09:11,300
I thought you were offering me the part.
我還以為 你們決定讓我飾演那個角色

151
00:09:11,580 --> 00:09:12,640
Why?
為什麼？

152
00:09:12,880 --> 00:09:16,410
I was Doctor Drake Ramoray, Stryker's twin brother.
我演過德瑞克醫生 他是史崔克的雙胞胎哥哥

153
00:09:16,650 --> 00:09:19,140
Who looks more like me than me,right?
誰會比我長得更像我呢？

154
00:09:19,820 --> 00:09:22,450
Everybody has to audition.
每個人都得參加試鏡

155
00:09:24,330 --> 00:09:27,260
You know, Terry, I don't really need to do this.
你知道的，泰瑞 我真的不需要這麼做

156
00:09:27,460 --> 00:09:30,160
I got my own cable TV series...
我有自己的第四台電視劇…

157
00:09:30,460 --> 00:09:32,260
with a robot.
跟機器人搭檔演出

158
00:09:33,770 --> 00:09:36,570
I'm sorry,Joey. That's the way it is.
對不起，喬伊 這是規定

159
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:38,740
Well...
那麼…

160
00:09:39,570 --> 00:09:41,910
I guess you think you're pretty special.
我猜你以為你很特別

161
00:09:42,140 --> 00:09:45,600
Sitting up here in your fancy, small-halled building...
你坐在漂亮的小辦公室裡…

162
00:09:47,250 --> 00:09:49,680
making stars jump through hoops for you.
要大明星在你面前試演

163
00:09:49,950 --> 00:09:51,440
Well,you know what?
你知道嗎？

164
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:56,120
This is one star whose hoop..
我就是那個大明星…

165
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:58,550
This is the star the hoop.. This hoop..
我就是試演的… 大明星試演…

166
00:09:58,790 --> 00:10:00,760
I was Doctor Drake Ramoray!
我是德瑞克醫生

167
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:10,960
Hi,Tag. What are you doing here?
泰格，你在這裡做什麼？

168
00:10:11,210 --> 00:10:14,640
I came to thank you for not laughing in my face yesterday.
我來謝謝你 昨天沒當著我的面笑我

169
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:18,310
I noticed there were no plants so I brought you your first.
我注意到你辦公室裡沒有植物 所以就幫你帶盆植物過來

170
00:10:18,810 --> 00:10:20,840
There is a plant in your office.
你辦公室裡有植物

171
00:10:21,680 --> 00:10:23,080
Kind of.
可以那麼說

172
00:10:24,020 --> 00:10:25,110
Right.
對

173
00:10:25,590 --> 00:10:29,490
So I guess I shouldn't put "good at noticing stuff" on my resume.
我猜我不應該在履歷表上寫著 「注意力敏銳」

174
00:10:30,020 --> 00:10:32,020
-Thank you. -Anyway...
-謝謝 -總之…

175
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:34,330
I'm guessing you hired somebody.
我猜你錄取了別人

176
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:36,190
Well...
那個嘛…

177
00:10:36,600 --> 00:10:37,830
Gotcha.
我猜中了

178
00:10:38,230 --> 00:10:40,330
Thanks again for meeting with me.
謝謝你願意面試我

179
00:10:42,200 --> 00:10:43,470
But I hired you.
但我錄取了你

180
00:10:45,410 --> 00:10:47,400
-What? -Yeah, you got the job.
-什麼？ -對，你得到了這份工作

181
00:10:47,640 --> 00:10:49,630
-You're my new assistant. -I am?
-你是我的新助理 -真的嗎？

182
00:10:49,880 --> 00:10:51,310
Yeah.
對

183
00:10:52,410 --> 00:10:55,750
-I can't believe it. -Me either.
-我不敢相信 -我也是

184
00:10:57,180 --> 00:10:59,310
First, I need you to go downstairs...
首先我要你到樓下…

185
00:10:59,450 --> 00:11:02,620
find a woman named Hilda, and tell her to go home.
找一個叫西爾達的女人 要她回家去

186
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:09,620
-Hey. -Hey, good you're home.
-嗨 -太好了，你回來了

187
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:13,130
Always nicer to hear than, "Oh,crap,you again."
我想這要比聽到 「該死，又是你」還好

188
00:11:14,900 --> 00:11:17,030
Hey, sweetie, I made you a surprise.
甜心，我幫你準備了一個大驚喜

189
00:11:17,270 --> 00:11:19,140
-Oh,yeah? -Yeah,tacos.
-是嗎？ -對，墨西哥卷餅

190
00:11:19,340 --> 00:11:22,330
Ever since that story, I've had such a craving.
聽完那個故事後 我一直都想吃墨西哥卷餅

191
00:11:24,380 --> 00:11:26,440
Did you not understand the story?
你聽不懂那個故事嗎？

192
00:11:28,750 --> 00:11:30,340
-Hey. -Hey,what's up?
-嗨 -嗨，有什麼事嗎？

193
00:11:31,050 --> 00:11:33,950
Nothing. Just figuring out what to do for dinner.
沒事 我只是想知道晚餐要吃什麼

194
00:11:36,590 --> 00:11:39,920
Hey,what's that? Dinner stuff? You making dinner?
嘿，那是什麼？晚餐嗎？ 你在做晚餐？

195
00:11:40,160 --> 00:11:41,250
No.
不

196
00:11:44,930 --> 00:11:46,520
What's over there? Tacos?
那是什麼？墨西哥卷餅嗎？

197
00:11:46,770 --> 00:11:48,390
No. No.
不

198
00:11:49,740 --> 00:11:53,470
They're just ground beef smileys.
它們只是牛肉包大餅

199
00:11:55,540 --> 00:11:56,770
Those are tacos.
那是墨西哥卷餅

200
00:11:56,980 --> 00:11:59,540
Excuse me, Mr. Mexico.
對不起，墨西哥先生

201
00:12:00,410 --> 00:12:04,320
Either way, I'll pass. Still can't eat those.
沒關係，我不吃了 我還是不敢吃那玩意

202
00:12:11,930 --> 00:12:13,220
What's so funny?
什麼事那麼好笑？

203
00:12:19,100 --> 00:12:20,690
I'm not laughing.
我沒有笑

204
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:31,100
You told her!
你跟她說了

205
00:12:32,150 --> 00:12:34,770
Nancy Thompson's getting fired.
南西湯普森被開除了

206
00:12:37,850 --> 00:12:41,910
Okay, okay. I had food poisoning. It's not like I chose to do it!
好吧，那時我食物中毒 我不是故意要那麼做

207
00:12:42,160 --> 00:12:46,020
It's not like I said, "What would make this ride more fun?"
我又沒有說： 「該怎麼做才會更好玩呢？」

208
00:12:47,030 --> 00:12:50,830
Right. You're right,I'm sorry. I shouldn't be laughing.
對，你說的對，抱歉 我不該笑的

209
00:12:51,100 --> 00:12:53,460
I should be laying down papers for you.
我應該幫你先鋪好報紙

210
00:12:56,540 --> 00:12:59,370
-How could you? -I had to. We're getting married.
-你怎麼可以？ -我非說不可，我們要結婚了

211
00:12:59,610 --> 00:13:02,100
Married couples can't keep secrets.
夫妻不該有秘密

212
00:13:02,310 --> 00:13:05,240
I guess Monica should know about Atlantic City.
我猜摩妮卡應該知道 在大西洋城發生的事

213
00:13:05,450 --> 00:13:06,880
Dude!
兄弟

214
00:13:08,150 --> 00:13:11,050
-What happened? -Chandler and I are in a bar...
-發生了什麼事？ -錢德跟我在酒吧裡…

215
00:13:11,290 --> 00:13:13,690
Did you not hear me say,"Dude"?
你沒有聽到我說「兄弟」嗎？

216
00:13:14,560 --> 00:13:17,850
and this girl is making eyes at Chandler.
有個女孩跟錢德拋媚眼

217
00:13:18,060 --> 00:13:22,860
So he goes over to her and, after a minute or two, I see them kissing.
他走過去 一、兩分鐘後我看到他們在接吻

218
00:13:23,260 --> 00:13:27,560
You're thinking he's not the type to go to bars and make out with girls.
你不會覺得他是那種會在酒吧裡 泡女人的男人

219
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:29,830
And you're right. He's not the type...
你是對的，他的確不是那種…

220
00:13:30,070 --> 00:13:34,200
to go to bars and makes out with girls.
在酒吧裡泡女人的男人

221
00:13:35,880 --> 00:13:37,870
You kissed a guy?
你跟男人接吻？

222
00:13:39,710 --> 00:13:41,310
Oh, my God!
我的天啊

223
00:13:41,520 --> 00:13:45,710
In my defense, it was dark and he was a very pretty guy.
我得為自己辯駁 那時很暗，而且他長得很漂亮

224
00:13:47,660 --> 00:13:49,280
Oh, Mon, I laughed so hard..
老妹，我笑得很大聲…

225
00:13:49,720 --> 00:13:53,180
So hard we had to throw out your underwear again?
你笑到又拉了一褲子？

226
00:13:55,560 --> 00:13:57,790
Whatever, dude. You kissed a guy.
隨便你，老兄，你吻了男人

227
00:14:04,470 --> 00:14:05,840
-Hi. -Hey.
-嗨 -嗨

228
00:14:06,270 --> 00:14:07,970
How's Hilda working out?
西爾達適應的還好吧？

229
00:14:08,410 --> 00:14:13,310
Oh,my new assistant is working out. Yes.
喔，我的新助理適應的很好，沒錯

230
00:14:13,810 --> 00:14:15,440
She happy she got the job?
她很高興能夠得到這份工作嗎？

231
00:14:15,650 --> 00:14:21,090
My new assistant is very happy that I hired my new assistant.
我的新助理非常高興 我僱用了我的新助理

232
00:14:23,320 --> 00:14:24,590
Hello.
喂

233
00:14:24,830 --> 00:14:27,160
Oh, hey! Can you hang on a second?
嘿，你能等一下嗎？

234
00:14:27,390 --> 00:14:31,520
It's the producers at Mac and Cheese, if you'll excuse me for a minute.
是《麥克與吉事》的製作人打來的 麻煩你們先別說話

235
00:14:33,300 --> 00:14:37,700
Hey,funny you should call. I was just looking over next week's script.
我沒想到你會打來 我正在看下星期的劇本

236
00:14:38,840 --> 00:14:40,200
Canceled!
取消了

237
00:14:41,310 --> 00:14:43,670
Like,they're taking it off the air?
他們不播了？

238
00:14:45,210 --> 00:14:48,150
All right, I'll see you Monday.
好吧，星期一見

239
00:14:48,850 --> 00:14:51,650
We're not even shooting them anymore?
不再拍了？

240
00:14:51,950 --> 00:14:54,180
All right. Bye.
好吧，再見

241
00:14:55,460 --> 00:14:57,550
They canceled Mac and Cheese!
他們取消了《麥克與吉事》

242
00:14:57,830 --> 00:14:59,160
-Sorry. -Sorry, Joey.
-我很遺憾 -我真的很遺憾，喬伊

243
00:14:59,360 --> 00:15:03,350
Why would they do that? It was a good show, right?
他們為什麼要那麼做？ 那齣戲很棒，對吧？

244
00:15:14,480 --> 00:15:16,970
You want to tell secrets? Okay,in college...
你想說秘密嗎？好吧，念大學時…

245
00:15:17,210 --> 00:15:20,240
Ross used to wear leg warmers.
羅斯都會穿衛生褲

246
00:15:21,820 --> 00:15:26,720
All right,Chandler entered a Vanilla Ice look-alike contest and won.
好吧，錢德參加模仿香草冰大賽 還拿到了冠軍

247
00:15:28,490 --> 00:15:30,680
Ross came in fourth and cried!
羅斯得了第四名，抱頭痛哭

249
00:15:33,390 --> 00:15:35,860
Oh, is that funny? You find that funny?
那很好笑嗎？ 你覺得那很好笑嗎？

250
00:15:36,060 --> 00:15:38,900
Maybe Chandler should know your secrets too.
或許錢德也應該 知道你的秘密

251
00:15:40,330 --> 00:15:43,240
I already told him everything. You shush!
我已經告訴他一切了 你給我閉嘴

252
00:15:44,200 --> 00:15:46,500
Once,she was sent to bed without dinner...
有一次她被罰不准吃晚餐…

253
00:15:46,740 --> 00:15:49,710
so she ate the macaroni off a jewelry box she'd made.
結果她吃掉了 她用意大利面做的珠寶盒

254
00:15:52,550 --> 00:15:56,210
Ross stayed home every Saturday night to watch Golden Girls.
羅斯每個星期六晚上 都待在家裡看《黃金女郎》

255
00:15:58,690 --> 00:16:01,280
Monica couldn't tell time until she was 13.
摩妮卡到十三歲才會看時間

256
00:16:03,420 --> 00:16:05,620
It's hard for some people!
有些人就是學不會

257
00:16:06,390 --> 00:16:08,050
Of course it is.
那當然

258
00:16:08,260 --> 00:16:10,250
Wow.
哇

259
00:16:10,730 --> 00:16:13,790
-Chandler wore my underwear to work! -Hey!
-錢德曾穿我的內褲去上班  -嘿

260
00:16:15,770 --> 00:16:18,600
I'm sorry,I couldn't think of any more for Ross.
對不起，我想不出來 羅斯還有什麼糗事

261
00:16:18,910 --> 00:16:20,930
In college, Chandler got drunk...
在大學時有一次錢德喝醉了…

262
00:16:21,080 --> 00:16:23,810
and slept with the lady who cleaned our dorm.
他跟打掃房間的清潔婦上床

263
00:16:24,910 --> 00:16:26,140
That was you.
那是你

264
00:16:29,050 --> 00:16:31,750
Whatever, dude. You kissed a guy.
隨便，兄弟，你吻了男人

265
00:16:34,050 --> 00:16:35,720
How could this happen to me?
這種事怎麼會發生在我身上？

266
00:16:35,960 --> 00:16:40,660
Yesterday,I had two TV shows. Today,I got nothing.
昨天我演出兩出電視劇 今天我什麼都沒有

267
00:16:40,930 --> 00:16:43,760
Wait a minute, what happened to Days of our Lives?
等一下，《我們的日子》呢？

268
00:16:43,960 --> 00:16:47,090
Well,they might be a little mad at me over there.
他們有點生我的氣

269
00:16:47,740 --> 00:16:48,760
What happened?
發生了什麼事？

270
00:16:49,040 --> 00:16:54,170
Well, maybe I got a little upset, and maybe I told them where they could go.
或許我有點太囂張 我告訴他們該怎麼做

271
00:16:54,680 --> 00:16:56,910
Joey, why would you do that?
喬伊，你為什麼要那麼做？

272
00:16:57,140 --> 00:16:59,610
Because! They wanted me to audition.
因為他們要我試鏡

273
00:16:59,810 --> 00:17:03,250
You,an actor? That's madness!
你可是個演員，那麼做太過份了

274
00:17:10,690 --> 00:17:12,560
Rachel Green's office.
瑞秋葛林辦公室

275
00:17:15,060 --> 00:17:16,090
Tag.
泰格

276
00:17:16,330 --> 00:17:17,800
Hi, who was that?
嗨，誰打電話找我？

277
00:17:18,170 --> 00:17:21,290
Nobody. I was just practicing.
沒有人，我只是在練習

278
00:17:21,570 --> 00:17:22,760
Really?
真的嗎？

279
00:17:28,340 --> 00:17:31,310
-Hi. -Hi, Rachel Green's office.
-嗨 -嗨，瑞秋葛林辦公室

280
00:17:32,950 --> 00:17:34,640
You must be Hilda.
你一定是西爾達

281
00:17:36,950 --> 00:17:40,320
He's Tag. This is Phoebe. Phoebe, can I see you for a sec?
他是泰格，這位是菲比 菲比，你能進來一下嗎？

282
00:17:40,590 --> 00:17:41,710
Phoebe.
菲比

283
00:17:42,220 --> 00:17:44,090
-Great name. -You like that?
-這個名字很不錯 -你喜歡嗎？

284
00:17:44,290 --> 00:17:46,950
-You should hear my phone number. -Okay.
-你應該聽聽我的電話號碼 -好吧，我們馬上回來

285
00:17:52,300 --> 00:17:55,290
So you hired yourself a little treat,did you?
你為了自己僱用那個大帥哥，對吧？

286
00:17:56,540 --> 00:17:58,870
I know how it looks, but I am telling you..
我知道這樣看起來像什麼 但是我要告訴你…

287
00:17:59,140 --> 00:18:01,630
You can't get involved with your assistant.
你不能勾搭你的助理

288
00:18:01,880 --> 00:18:06,610
I know that, and I know hiring him was not the smartest thing I've ever done.
我知道，我知道僱用他 不是明智之舉

289
00:18:06,850 --> 00:18:10,540
But,from now on, I swear this is strictly professional.
但從現在開始 我發誓我們之間是純公事

290
00:18:10,820 --> 00:18:12,220
-Yes. -Hey,Rachel.
-對 -嘿，瑞秋

291
00:18:12,420 --> 00:18:13,480
Hi.
嗨

292
00:18:13,720 --> 00:18:16,250
Cute assistant. What's his story?
你助理很帥，他死會了嗎？

293
00:18:16,520 --> 00:18:18,750
-Is he.. -Gay? Yeah.
-他… -是同性戀嗎？對

294
00:18:23,730 --> 00:18:26,820
Hey, Terry.
嘿，泰瑞

295
00:18:27,070 --> 00:18:28,330
Joey Tribbiani.
是喬伊崔比亞尼

296
00:18:28,540 --> 00:18:32,230
Surprised your big head could fit through our small halls.
我很訝異像你這樣的大人物 會到我們的小辦公室來

297
00:18:33,440 --> 00:18:35,570
-I gotta go,Joey. -Wait,Terry! Look.
-我得走了，喬伊 -等一下，泰瑞，聽我說

298
00:18:35,840 --> 00:18:37,740
I'm really sorry about before.
之前的事我抱歉

299
00:18:38,010 --> 00:18:41,210
I was an idiot, thinking I'm too big to audition for you.
我是個白癡，以為自己很大牌 根本不必做試鏡

300
00:18:41,450 --> 00:18:43,680
-Give me another chance. -I can't.
-再給我一次機會 -我辦不到

301
00:18:43,880 --> 00:18:45,720
Wait,Terry, please!
等一下，泰瑞，求求你

302
00:18:46,650 --> 00:18:48,920
Look,I just lost my other job, okay?
聽著，我失去了我另一份工作

303
00:18:49,190 --> 00:18:52,350
You have no idea how much I need this.
你不知道我多需要這齣戲

304
00:18:52,590 --> 00:18:54,080
Please, help me out.
求求你幫幫我

305
00:18:54,460 --> 00:18:56,400
For old times' sake.
我們是老朋友了

306
00:18:57,700 --> 00:19:01,030
This guy's been in a coma for five years. It's hopeless.
這傢伙昏迷了五年 他已經沒希望了

307
00:19:01,270 --> 00:19:04,260
It's not. Dr. Stryker Ramoray is a miracle worker.
不會的，史崔克醫生擅長展現奇跡

308
00:19:04,570 --> 00:19:05,560
Here he comes.
他來了

309
00:19:06,470 --> 00:19:07,870
Good morning.
早安

310
00:19:14,110 --> 00:19:18,710
Drake, it's your brother, Stryker. Can you hear me?
德瑞克，我是你弟弟史崔克 你聽到了嗎？

311
00:19:18,990 --> 00:19:20,980
And cut.
卡

312
00:19:22,960 --> 00:19:25,190
I'm back, baby!
我又回來了，寶貝

313
00:19:37,500 --> 00:19:39,900
You know,in my defense...
我的解釋是…

314
00:19:40,140 --> 00:19:43,740
there was no glitter on the macaroni and very little glue.
意大利面上沒有珠寶 而且我用的膠水很少

315
00:19:44,210 --> 00:19:47,740
And in my defense, the cleaning lady came on to me.
我的解釋是 那個清潔婦勾引我

316
00:19:49,220 --> 00:19:52,210
-Do you have trouble telling time now? -No.
-你現在會看時間了嗎？ -會

317
00:19:52,450 --> 00:19:55,150
-Quick, what time is it? -Time to kiss a guy?
-快點，現在幾點了？ -吻男人的時間到了嗎？

318
00:19:59,330 --> 00:20:02,090
What are you laughing at, Pampers?
你在笑什麼？尿布寶寶

319
00:20:04,460 --> 00:20:06,490
You know when I said married people...
你知道我說夫妻…

320
00:20:06,770 --> 00:20:09,600
should share everything and not have any secrets?
應該分享一切 不可以有秘密嗎？

321
00:20:09,840 --> 00:20:13,530
-Yeah? -That was stupid. Let's not do that.
-怎麼了？ -那太蠢了，我們千萬別那麼做

322
00:20:14,340 --> 00:20:15,330
Absolutely.
一點都沒錯

323
00:20:15,510 --> 00:20:19,640
We should keep the stuff we told each other secret from everyone else.
我們不該把告訴彼此的秘密 再告訴其他人

324
00:20:19,880 --> 00:20:21,750
Yeah,definitely.
一點都沒錯

325
00:20:23,250 --> 00:20:25,120
Okay. If you'll excuse me...
好吧，對不起…

326
00:20:25,350 --> 00:20:29,520
I'm gonna hang out with people who don't know the Space Mountain story.
我要跟不知道 太空山事件的人去玩了

327
00:20:30,120 --> 00:20:34,030
-Then I'd steer clear of Phoebe. -Man!
-我建議你別去找菲比 -天啊

328
00:20:35,560 --> 00:20:40,000
Not that you would, but I wouldn't hang out with the guys at my office.
一點都沒錯 我也建議你別去找我同事

329
00:20:51,380 --> 00:20:52,400
Hi.
嗨

330
00:20:54,720 --> 00:20:57,180
-Do you have a minute? -Sure. What's up?
-你有空嗎？ -當然，有什麼事嗎？

331
00:20:57,850 --> 00:21:01,250
I got asked out twice today while I was at lunch...
今天我吃午餐的時候 有兩個人想約我出去…

332
00:21:01,520 --> 00:21:03,220
by guys.
他們都是男人

333
00:21:05,590 --> 00:21:06,720
-Really? -Yeah.
-真的嗎？ -對

334
00:21:07,160 --> 00:21:09,360
Did you tell someone that I was gay?
你告訴別人我是同性戀嗎？

335
00:21:09,560 --> 00:21:12,900
Oh,did you not want people to know that?
你不希望別人知道嗎？

336
00:21:14,230 --> 00:21:18,970
I'm not gay. I especially wouldn't want you to think I was gay.
我不是同性戀，我特別不希望 你以為我是同性戀

337
00:21:19,470 --> 00:21:21,030
Why is that?
為什麼？

338
00:21:22,980 --> 00:21:26,470
-I don't think I should say. -Oh,you can say.
-我想我不該說的 -你說吧

339
00:21:28,280 --> 00:21:31,980
Come on, I don't want you to feel like you can't tell me things.
別這樣，我不希望 你有事不敢告訴我

340
00:21:34,690 --> 00:21:35,850
-Okay. -Okay.
-好吧 -好吧

341
00:21:36,860 --> 00:21:38,690
-Well... -Yeah.
-那個… -是的

342
00:21:39,060 --> 00:21:41,430
I'd love to ask out your friend Phoebe.
我想約你朋友菲比出去

343
00:21:44,500 --> 00:21:46,230
Yeah, she's gay.
是啊，她是同性戀

344
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


345
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000

